Papa i: ['kope'] hana: {
	>> kope := Papa hou.
	iho pākahi: { :helu :section
		kope pākuʻi-hope: section kāhea-iā-ia-iho kope.
	}. <- kope.
}.

>> sheep := Papa hou ; ['Dolly'] ; ['Shaun']. 
>> clones := sheep kope.
clones pākahi: { :helu :sheep
	sheep pākuʻi-hope: ['2'].
}.

Huapuka kākau: sheep, laina-hou.
Huapuka kākau: clones, laina-hou.
